{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20155","headline":"和蔷薇花歌 · 孟郊","name":"和蔷薇花歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙机札札织凤皇，花开七十有二行。\n天霞落地攒红光，风枝嫋嫋时一扬。\n飞散葩馥遶空王，忽惊锦浪洗新色。\n又似宫娃逞妆饰，终当一使移花根，还比蒲桃天上植。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}